        <item>
            <title>1.45.1</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new in 1.45.1</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Client deposits</b> — send / void deposits and track open ones (sent/paid) in a new Deposits tab.</li>
  <li><b>Contract lifecycle</b> — normal / sent / signed states, void a sent contract, and a clear "Contract Signed" indicator.</li>
  <li><b>Document tools</b> — a per-document preview column (CL/INT/SUB/CON), a Generate Docs action, and document codes.</li>
  <li><b>Pre-sign form</b> — confirm contact, secondary contact, start date, and send/draft before sending a contract.</li>
  <li><b>Incentives</b> — value tiers, pricing-zone rules, exception requests, and expired-date protection.</li>
  <li>Saved custom items, plus many QA fixes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
